<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  Network interface inventory modeled after dent.xml conventions.
  Uses child elements (not attributes) for all data, including sort keys.
  Interfaces in document order (unsorted); units within each interface
  are also in document order (unsorted).

  Verifies real-world data patterns:
    - gr-1/2/0 has 5 units: exercises heterogeneous inner iteration count
    - Most interfaces have exactly 1 unit: exercises the common single case
    - Some units have tunnel, some have family, some have both, some neither
    - Some units have description, some do not
    - lo0 has two addresses in the family (but we only look at unit level)
-->
